+# FL Design Overview (Aegis)
+
+Summary
+- We provide a server-client design that integrates with ADK evidence, cosign/Rekor signing, Redis orchestration, and validator workers.
+- Threat model: assume honest-but-curious aggregator until secure-aggregation/DP are integrated; plan for attestation to harden trust.
+
+Components & interactions
+- Server: round controller (ops/fl/server.py), persists updates, triggers aggregation and evidence bundling.
+- Client SDK: lightweight agent (ops/fl/client_sdk.py) for local training, bundling/sending updates and consent capture.
